  "question": {
    "text": "The area (in sq. units) bounded by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> with the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis, from <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> to <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
  },
